  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Communications Costs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO will work with stakeholders to ensure the provision of content informed by audience insight (avoiding humanitarian content given the public&#x2019;s existing good levels of exposure to it).  Instead, content will be aligned with White Paper themes, will demonstrate the core importance of partnerships, and will be spent within the scope of the International Development Act 2002 and DAC rules on ODA eligibility.</narrative>
  </description>
